Mage (swap spellbook)=
With the introduction and expansion of [[Elemental weakness]], players can use [[Wind surge]] and [[Fire surge]] as a primary source of damage when fighting [[Xarpus]] (50% air weakness), and [[Verzik Vitur]] 2nd and 3rd form (50% fire weakness while on her final form). Considering mager's role is to freeze [[Nylocas Matomenos]] during Maiden's encounter, using surge spells is only possible by carrying a [[Magic cape]], allowing to switch from one spellbook to another up to 5 times. This means the method can only be used limited amount of times per day.
<br /><br />
With [[Confliction gauntlets]], [[Ahrim the Blighted's equipment]] set effect together with [[Amulet of the Damned]] offers best magic DPS when casting surge spells, while also allowing to autocast ancient magicks. The high accuracy provided from the gauntlets also makes [[Ice barrage]] autocasting compete with melee against [[Sotetseg]].
<br /><br />
Standard spellbook allows the use of [[Vulnerability]], which reduces target defence by 10% (or 15% with [[tome of water]]), shortening the raid duration by a reasonable amount. This is the only defence reduction method available during this combat achievement. It cannot be cast against [[Sotetseg]] and [[Verzik Vitur]] in any of her forms. Bringing [[Dust rune]]s allows to cast this spell without wasting extra inventory space.

