==Trivia==
*The achievement's name is a reference to the ''Old School RuneScape'' content creator ''Settled'', known for his series ''Swampletics'' where he attempts to complete the Theatre of Blood on an [[Ironman Mode#Ultimate|Ultimate Ironman]] that can't leave Morytania.

